Useful operator commands:

- `/dungeon generate <id>` · `/dungeon wipe <id>`
- `/dungeon piece <id> <piece>` · `/dungeon pieces <id>`
- `/dungeon reload` · `/dungeon list`
- `/dungeon givekey <id>` · `/dungeon placeportal`
- `/dungeon complete <id>` · `/dungeon return`
- `/dungeon simulate` · `/dungeon event reset` · `/dungeon event resetall`

Global options in config include `return_button_item`, cooldowns, `protect_structures`, `teleport_charge_seconds`, and `portal_activation_radius`.

After editing packs, `/dungeon reload`, then generate or activate a keyed portal. Verify spawn, connectivity, uniques, sealed openings, and dungeon event markers before you ship the pack.
